ekarang.","First Quarter":"Suku Pertama","Moderate visibility.":"Keterlihatan sederhana.","Waning Gibbous":"Purnama Surut","Waxing Crescent":"Sabit Membesar","Poor visibility.":"Keterlihatan lemah.","Perfectly clear view.":"Pandangan yang sangat jelas.","Good visibility.":"Keterlihatan yang baik.","New Moon":"Anak Bulan","Very poor visibility.":"Keterlihatan yang sangat lemah.","Excellent visibility.":"Keterlihatan yang sangat baik.","Waning Crescent":"Sabit Surut","Last Quarter":"Suku Terakhir","Waxing Gibbous":"Purnama Besar","Full Moon":"Bulan Purnama","Center on location":"Pusatkan pada lokasi","Data sources":"Sumber data","Forecast time":"Masa ramalan","Loading wind forecast…":"Memuatkan ramalan angin…","Map layers":"Lapisan peta","Now":"Sekarang","Open wind map":"Buka peta angin","Pause":"Jeda","Play":"Main","Retry":"Cuba lagi","The arrows move in the direction the wind travels. The direction label shows where the wind comes from.":"Garisan bergerak mengikut arah tiupan angin. Label arah menunjukkan dari mana angin datang.","Wind Map":"Peta Angin","Wind Speed":"Kelajuan Angin","Wind between forecast locations is estimated. Local conditions can differ, especially near mountains and coasts.":"Angin antara titik ramalan ialah anggaran. Keadaan setempat mungkin berbeza, terutama berhampiran gunung dan pantai.","Wind data unavailable":"Data angin tidak tersedia","Your Locations":"Lokasi Anda","Map Data":"Data Peta","Weather data provided by Apple has been modified to create forecast maps.":"Data cuaca daripada Apple telah diolah untuk menghasilkan peta ramalan.","cardinal.N":"N","cardinal.NNE":"NNE","cardinal.NE":"NE","cardinal.ENE":"ENE","cardinal.E":"E","cardinal.ESE":"ESE","cardinal.SE":"SE","cardinal.SSE":"SSE","cardinal.S":"S","cardinal.SSW":"SSW","cardinal.SW":"SW","cardinal.WSW":"WSW","cardinal.W":"W","cardinal.WNW":"WNW","cardinal.NW":"NW","cardinal.NNW":"NNW","Temperature":"Suhu","%@'s chance: %d%%":"Peluang %@: %d%%","About Feels Like Temperature":"Mengenai suhu terasa","About Wind Speed and Gusts":"Mengenai Kelajuan Angin dan Tiupan","About the Beaufort Scale":"Mengenai Skala Beaufort","The dew point is what the temperature would need to fall to for dew to form. It can be a useful way to tell how humid the air feels — the higher the dew point, the more humid it feels. A dew point that matches the current temperature means the relative humidity is 100%, and there may be dew or fog.":"Takat embun ialah suhu yang perlu turun untuk embun terbentuk. Ia boleh menjadi cara yang berguna untuk mengetahui rasa lembap udara — semakin tinggi takat embun, semakin lembap rasanya. Titik embun yang sepadan dengan suhu semasa bermakna kelembapan relatif ialah 100%, dan mungkin terdapat embun atau kabus.","About Dew Point":"Mengenai takat embun","Relative humidity, commonly known just as humidity, is the amount of moisture in the air compared with what the air can hold. The air can hold more moisture at higher temperatures. A relative humidity near 100% means there may be dew or fog.":"Kelembapan relatif, biasanya dikenali hanya sebagai kelembapan, ialah jumlah kelembapan di udara berbanding dengan apa yang boleh ditahan oleh udara. Udara boleh menahan lebih banyak lembapan pada suhu yang lebih tinggi. Kelembapan relatif hampir 100% bermakna mungkin terdapat embun atau kabus.","About Relative Humidity":"Mengenai Kelembapan Relatif","Intensity is calculated based on how much rain or snow falls per hour and is meant to indicate how heavy the rain or snow will feel. It is also used with other precipitation types such as sleet and wintry mix. A downpour or heavy snowstorm can have a \"heavy\" intensity, while an average rainfall or lighter drizzle can have a \"moderate\" or \"light\" intensity.":"Keamatan dikira berdasarkan jumlah hujan atau salji yang turun setiap jam dan bertujuan untuk menunjukkan betapa lebatnya hujan atau salji. Ia juga digunakan untuk jenis kerpasan lain seperti hujan batu bercampur air dan campuran musim sejuk. Hujan lebat atau ribut salji yang kuat boleh mempunyai keamatan “lebat”, manakala hujan biasa atau gerimis yang lebih ringan boleh mempunyai keamatan “sederhana” atau “ringan”.","About Precipitation Intensity":"Mengenai Intensiti Kerpasan","Significant, rapid changes in pressure are used to predict changes in the weather. For example, a drop in pressure can mean that rain or snow is on the way, and rising pressure can mean that weather will improve. Pressure is also called barometric pressure or atmospheric pressure.":"Perubahan tekanan yang ketara dan pantas digunakan untuk meramalkan perubahan cuaca. Sebagai contoh, penurunan tekanan boleh bermakna bahawa hujan atau salji sedang dalam perjalanan, dan tekanan yang meningkat boleh bermakna cuaca akan bertambah baik. Tekanan juga dipanggil tekanan barometrik atau tekanan atmosfera.","About Pressure":"Mengenai Tekanan","Visibility tells you how far away you can clearly see objects like buildings and hills. It is a measure of the transparency of the air and does not take into account the amount of sunlight or the presence of obstructions. Visibility at or above %@ is considered clear.":"Keterlihatan memberitahu anda sejauh mana anda boleh melihat dengan jelas objek seperti bangunan dan bukit. Ia adalah ukuran ketelusan udara dan tidak mengambil kira jumlah cahaya matahari atau kehadiran halangan. Keterlihatan pada atau lebih tinggi %@ dianggap jelas.","About Visibility":"Mengenai Keterlihatan","Actual":"sebenarnya","Calm":"Tenang","Light air":"Udara ringan","Storm":"ribut","Violent storm":"ribut ganas","Hurricane-force":"Kuasa taufan","Light breeze":"Angin sepoi-sepoi","Gentle breeze":"Angin sepoi-sepoi","Moderate breeze":"Angin sederhana","Fresh breeze":"Angin segar","Strong breeze":"Angin yang kuat","High wind":"Angin kencang","Gale":"Angin kencang","Strong gale":"Angin yang kuat","Description":"Penerangan","Beaufort Scale":"Skala Beaufort","Chance of Precipitation":"Peluang Hujan","Clear":"Cerah","Foggy":"berkabus","Hazy":"Jerebu","Conditions":"syarat","%d° now with %@ conditions. There is a precipitation chance of %@. Wind from %@ with gusts up to %d %@. Today's temperature ranges from %d° to %d° and feels like %d°. %@, and %@.":"%d° kini dengan keadaan %@. Terdapat kemungkinan kerpasan %@. Angin dari %@ dengan tiupan sehingga %d %@. Suhu hari ini berjulat dari %d° hingga %d° dan terasa seperti %d°. %@, dan %@.","Daily Summary":"Ringkasan Harian","The daily chance of precipitation tends to be higher than the chance for each hour.":"Peluang hujan harian cenderung lebih tinggi daripada peluang untuk setiap jam.","The dew point is %d° to %d°.":"Takat embun ialah %d° hingga %d°.","The dew point will be %d° to %d°.":"Takat embun ialah %d° hingga %d°.","Feels Like conveys how warm or cold it feels and can be different from the actual temperature. The Feels Like temperature is affected by humidity, sunlight and wind.":"Suhu terasa menunjukkan betapa panas atau sejuknya keadaan dirasakan dan boleh berbeza daripada suhu sebenar. Ia dipengaruhi oleh kelembapan, cahaya matahari dan angin.","On %@, the average humidity will be %d%%.\n%@":"Pada %@, purata kelembapan ialah %d%%.\n%@","Today, the average humidity is %d%%. %@":"Hari ini, purata kelembapan ialah %d%%. %@","On %@, the total precipitation will be %.1f%@.":"Pada %@, jumlah kerpasan ialah %.1f%@.","On %@, the lowest visibility will be %@ at %d %@, and the highest will be %@ at %d %@.":"Pada %@, keterlihatan paling rendah ialah %@ pada %d %@ dan yang tertinggi ialah %@ pada %d %@.","Today, the visibility will be %@, at %d to %d %@.":"Hari ini, keterlihatan ialah %@, pada %d hingga %d %@.","H: %d°":"Tertinggi: %d°","Humidity around %d%%":"Kelembapan sekitar %d%%","Humidity Avg %d%%":"Purata Kelembapan %d%%","Humidity %d%%":"Kelembapan %d%%","Today's min %d%% – max %d%%":"Minimum hari ini %d%% – maks %d%%","LAST 24 HOURS":"24 JAM TERAKHIR","L: %d°":"Terendah: %d°","NEXT 24 HOURS":"24 JAM SETERUSNYA","No hourly data available for this day.":"Tiada data setiap jam tersedia untuk hari ini.","%@'s low is %d° and the high is %d°. The temperature will feel like %d° to %d°. Wind from %@ is expected. %@":"%@ rendah ialah %d° dan tinggi ialah %d°. Suhu akan terasa seperti %d° hingga %d°. Angin dari %@ dijangka. %@","Hourly bars for rain & snow (%@).":"Bar setiap jam untuk hujan & salji (%@).","Heavy":"berat","Precipitation: 0%@":"Kerpasan: 0%@","Rain: %.1f%@":"Hujan: %.1f%@","Rain: %.1f%@, Snow: %.1f%@":"Hujan: %.1f%@, Salji: %.1f%@","Precipitation Totals":"Jumlah Kerpasan","On %@, the average pressure will be %@ %@, and the lowest pressure will be %@ %@.":"Pada %@, tekanan purata ialah %@ %@, dan tekanan terendah ialah %@ %@.","Pressure Average %@ %@":"Purata Tekanan %@ %@","Pressure %@ %@":"Tekanan %@ %@","Daily range: %@–%@ %@":"Julat harian: %@–%@ %@","Rain":"Hujan","Snow":"Salji","The Beaufort wind scale expresses how forceful or strong the wind is at a given speed. The Beaufort scale may make it easier to understand how windy it will feel or how much effect the wind could have. Each value on the scale corresponds to a wind speed range.":"Skala angin Beaufort menyatakan betapa kuat atau kuatnya angin pada kelajuan tertentu. Skala Beaufort mungkin memudahkan untuk memahami perasaan berangin atau kesan yang boleh diberikan oleh angin. Setiap nilai pada skala sepadan dengan julat kelajuan angin.","The actual air temperature.":"Suhu udara sebenar.","The wind speed is calculated using the average over a short period of time. Gusts are short bursts of wind above this average. A gust typically lasts under 20 seconds.":"Kelajuan angin dikira menggunakan purata dalam tempoh masa yang singkat. Tiupan angin ialah hembusan angin pendek melebihi purata ini. Tiupan angin biasanya berlangsung di bawah 20 saat.","Today's chance: %d%%":"Peluang hari ini: %d%%","Total":"Jumlah","No moderate or higher UV levels are expected for this day.":"Tiada tahap UV sederhana atau lebih tinggi dijangka untuk hari ini.","Sun protection recommended. UV levels range from %@ to %@, reached between %@ and %@.":"Perlindungan matahari disyorkan. Tahap UV berjulat daripada %@ hingga %@, dicapai antara %@ dan %@.","Today's %@ %d":"%@ %d hari ini","UV index up to %d":"Indeks UV sehingga %d","Visibility %d %@":"Keterlihatan %d %@","min %d – max %d %@":"min %d – maks %d %@","What the temperature feels like as a result of humidity, sunlight or wind.":"Apakah perasaan suhu akibat kelembapan, cahaya matahari atau angin.","Gusts up to %d":"Tiupan angin sehingga %d","Wind Speed %d":"Kelajuan Angin %d","Wind Speed %d-%d":"Kelajuan Angin %d-%d","Wind is currently %1$d %2$@ from the %3$@. Today, wind speeds are %4$d to %5$d %2$@, with gusts up to %6$d %2$@.":"Angin pada masa ini %1$d %2$@ daripada %3$@. Hari ini, kelajuan angin ialah %4$d hingga %5$d %2$@, dengan tiupan angin sehingga %6$d %2$@.","Wind speeds range from %1$d to %2$d %3$@, with gusts up to %4$d %3$@.":"Kelajuan angin berjulat dari %1$d hingga %2$d %3$@, dengan tiupan tiupan sehingga %4$d %3$@.","Weather views":"Pandangan cuaca","Max S":"Kelajuan maks.","Max G":"Tiupan maks.","Illumination":"Pencahayaan","10-DAY FORECAST":"RAMALAN 10 HARI","Choose Reader, Writer, or Owner. Owners can also share this event and manage access.":"Pilih Pembaca, Editor atau Pemilik. Pemilik juga boleh berkongsi acara ini dan mengurus akses.","People with this event":"Orang dengan acara ini","People with this calendar":"Orang dengan akses kepada kalendar ini","Not signed in":"Belum log masuk","Original creator":"Pencipta asal","Invitation pending":"Belum lama diundangkan","Cloud Calendars user":"Kalendar Gnome","Resend":"Hantar semula","Remove Access":"Alih keluar akses","Remove Access?":"Alih keluar akses?","People appear here after they add the event.":"Orang-orang muncul di sini setelah mereka menambahkan acara.","Loading sharing settings…":"Memuatkan tetapan perkongsian…","Signing in…":"Sedang log masuk…","Up next":"Seterusnya","No Title":"Tiada Tajuk","Bookings"